# 📋 PHASE DEVELOPMENT & FITUR PER ROLE

## 🚀 PHASE DEVELOPMENT (6 Bulan / 24 Sessions)

### **PHASE 1: Setup & Core (Month 1-2) - Session 4-11**
- Session 4: Project structure (Django + React)
- Session 5: Database (PostgreSQL + models)
- Session 6-7: Authentication (register, login, password)
- Session 8-9: Master Data (katalog, kategori, supplier)
- Session 10-11: Basic CRUD API + Frontend integration

### **PHASE 2: Features (Month 3-4) - Session 12-19**
- Session 12-13: Input Stok + Barcode generator
- Session 14-15: Transaksi POS (scan, cart, payment)
- Session 16-17: Laporan (daily, periodic, product sales)
- Session 18-19: Dashboard + Monitoring real-time

### **PHASE 3: ML Integration (Month 5-6) - Session 20-24**
- Session 20-21: ML Models training (5 predictions)
- Session 22: ML API integration
- Session 23: Testing & bug fixes
- Session 24: Deployment & documentation

