## 🔗 RELASI ANTAR FITUR & ROLE

### **Chain Effect 1: Admin Setup → Kasir Operasional**
```
Admin: Registrasi 
  → Generate business_code (AB12CD)
  → Admin: Buat Katalog (50 produk)
  → Admin: Input Stok (generate barcode)
  → Admin: Buat User Kasir (username: kasir1)
  → Kasir: Login (business_code + kasir1)
  → Kasir: Transaksi POS (scan barcode)
  → Sistem: FIFO automatic (update batch lama)
  → Admin: Monitoring transaksi kasir
```

### **Chain Effect 2: Input Stok → Transaksi → ML Prediction**
```
Admin: Input Stok Batch A (200 pcs, tgl 15 Mar)
  → Sistem: Generate barcode 02150326001
  → Admin: Print & tempel sticker
  
Admin: Input Stok Batch B (250 pcs, tgl 20 Mar)
  → Sistem: Generate barcode 02200326001
  
Kasir: Scan barcode 02200326001 (customer ambil batch baru)
  → Sistem: FIFO auto pilih Batch A (tgl 15 Mar, lebih lama)
  → Update: Batch A stock 200→199, Batch B tetap 250
  
After 3 months transactions:
  → Sistem: ML Training cron (jam 00:00)
  → Analyze: Sales velocity product 02
  → Predict: Stockout dalam 7 hari (confidence 85%)
  → Admin: Lihat prediction → Action: Restock now!
```

### **Chain Effect 3: Payment Setup → Kasir Payment Flow**
```
Admin: Setup Payment QRIS (upload QR image merchant.png)
  → Sistem: Save to PaymentMethod table
  
Admin: Setup Payment Bank BCA (1234567890, A/N Sara)
  → Sistem: Save to PaymentMethod table
  
Kasir: Transaksi POS → Customer pilih "QRIS"
  → Sistem: Query PaymentMethod WHERE business_id=1 AND method_type='qris'
  → Display: Modal dengan QR image merchant.png
  → Customer: Scan QR → Bayar
  → Kasir: Klik "Sudah Bayar" → Transaksi complete
  
Admin: Monitoring transaksi
  → View: 18 transaksi QRIS hari ini (Rp 450.000)
  → Insight: QRIS payment populer (60% dari total)
```

### **Chain Effect 4: Business Code Rotation → Security**
```
Admin: Curiga code bocor (ex-kasir tahu AB12CD)
  → Admin: Generate business_code baru
  → Sistem: Update business.business_code = "XY89PQ"
  → Old code "AB12CD" = INVALID instantly
  
Kasir (active session): Tetap bisa kerja (session persist)
  
Kasir (logout): Coba login dengan "AB12CD"
  → Sistem: Business not found (code invalid)
  → Login GAGAL ✅
  
Kasir: Login dengan "XY89PQ" (code baru dari admin)
  → Sistem: Business found, auth success
  → Login SUCCESS ✅
  
Ex-kasir: Coba login dengan "AB12CD" (code lama)
  → Sistem: Business not found
  → BLOCKED ✅ (security achieved!)
```

